flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Load environment variables using dotenv]
    B --> C[Import Express and connectDB]
    C --> D[Create Express application]
    D --> E[Enable JSON middleware]
    E --> F[Define GET / route]
    F --> G[Call startServer]
    G --> H[Try to connect to MongoDB]
    H --> I{Connection successful?}

    I -- Yes --> J[Read PORT from environment]
    J --> K[Use default port 3001 if PORT is missing]
    K --> L[Start Express server on 0.0.0.0]
    L --> M[Log API running message]
    M --> N([Server Running])

    I -- No --> O[Catch connection error]
    O --> P[Log MongoDB connection failure]
    P --> Q[process.exit 1]
    Q --> R([Application Terminated])

    style A fill:#d5f5e3,stroke:#229954,color:#000
    style I fill:#fcf3cf,stroke:#d4ac0d,color:#000
    style N fill:#d5f5e3,stroke:#229954,color:#000
    style O fill:#fadbd8,stroke:#cb4335,color:#000
    style R fill:#fadbd8,stroke:#cb4335,color:#000